    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d126-a2">

                <pb facs="0310" n="214" sameAs="frus:frus1879/pg214"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No.
                    123.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1879-02-03"><hi rendition="#italic">February</hi> 3,
                        1879</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">To their Excellencies the Ministers,
                        Members of the Tsung-li Yamen:</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gentlemen</hi>: I have communicated to my colleagues
                    the letter your excellencies did me the honor to address to me on the 11th
                    January last, and beg to say we are unanimously of opinion that the regulations
                    relating to the harbor of Shanghai having then consented to between your
                    excellencies and the members of the diplomatic body at Peking, no alterations
                    can be made by the Chinese Government in these regulations without the assent of
                    the parties thereto.</p>
                <p>Please accept, &amp;c.</p>
                <closer><signed><list>
                            <item>The <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister for France in
                                    China</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Doyen of the Diplomatic
                                    Body.</hi></item>
                            <item>The <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minester for Peru</hi>.</item>
                            <item>The <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chargé d’affaires for
                                Russia.</hi></item>
                            <item>The <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chargé d’affaires for
                                    Germany.</hi></item>
                            <item>The <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chargé d’affaires for the United
                                    States.</hi></item>
                            <item>The <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chargé d’affaires for
                                    England.</hi></item>
                        </list></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
